  "family_quality_rules": [
    "Funerary identity comes from substantial architecture and markers, not skull wallpaper.",
    "Use one or two large spooky forms and preserve open coloring regions.",
    "Gore and corpse clutter are not environmental texture.",
    "Ruins should remain readable as former chapels, tombs, gates, or battleworks."
